plurx-player (0.4.0+lp7.387.0.mpv0.41.0+git20261026.e59d90c-1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Replace mpv's stock on-screen controller with Cinema-style playback
    chrome: full-film seeking, transport, stream track menus, playback
    information, speed/audio sync, fullscreen and four-second auto-hide.
    Keep the private mpv decoder, display management and session owner.
  * Show scoped library title, episode identity and synopsis; resolve Next
    on the server without granting general browsing access. Autoplay can be
    disabled in Settings and its choice is saved locally.
  * Auto, Original and advertised quality rungs use the existing server
    decision/session path, retaining film position and paused state.
  * Closed-form equations unchanged: tools/dv_processing dm 193c40343ebf.

